From b7af13b0281aeb40dbd95e669171f9d8d2a39c8e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 23:44:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix auto-AI freeze from analyze slot leak

Defer the pre-held analyze slot release before any early return in
AnalyzeTender so FreeAnalyzeSlots cannot stay at 0 after ListDocuments
or empty-corpus failures. Periodically requeue stuck analyzing and old
failed (other) cards with document text, and return transient LLM
errors to none so auto mode keeps draining ready cards.
